TI  - The predictive value of atherogenic index of plasma for cardiovascular outcomes in patients with acute coronary syndrome undergoing percutaneous coronary intervention with LDL-C below 1.8mmol/L
PY  - 2023
T2  - Cardiovascular Diabetology
VL  - 22
IS  - 1
