AB  - The proceedings contain 141 papers. The topics discussed include: early results of carotid endarterectomy and coronary artery bypass grafting as a simultaneous surgery for patients with combined hemodynamic significant stenoses of the coronary and carotid arteries; the effect of combined thermal exposure on the distribution of properties in a 45 steel permanent joint; numerical simulation of high-velocity interaction between a metal grid and a projectile; the impact of hydrological processes and the state of the hatassy-pavlovsk underwater crossing of the tgpl across the lena river; studying the causes for the destruction of shutoff equipment in water supply systems on upper floors of high-rise apartment buildings; interactive software for calculating energy and force parameters of metal extrusion; and describing the properties of textured polycrystals in terms of their own elastic states.
