TI  - "Atherogenic index of plasma" (log10 triglyceride/high-density lipoprotein-cholesterol) predicts high blood pressure, diabetes, and vascular events
PY  - 2010
T2  - Journal of Clinical Lipidology
VL  - 4
IS  - 2
