TI  - Diagnosis of atherosclerosis. I. Correlation between clinical diagnosis, serum cholesterol and low-density lipoproteins, and resting and exercise electrocardiograms
PY  - 1958
T2  - The American Journal of Cardiology
VL  - 1
IS  - 3
SP  - 315
EP  - 322
